      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_murong_qing_si"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a famous Northern Plains lone cultivator with the nickname Cloud Gentleman. Longevity Heaven approves his marriage to Murong Qing Si.",
      "chapters": [
        1444
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "marriage-approval",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_longevity_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On the day he is to propose at Murong tribe, Murong Qing Si’s life tablet Gu and soul lantern Gu for him shatter. She follows his route and finds a ruined battlefield with signs of a huge fight, and calling his name brings no answer.",
      "chapters": [
        1445
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_murong_tribe",
        "gu_soul_lantern_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan reads the killing as Heavenly Court wrecking Longevity Heaven’s preparation: Longevity Heaven had agreed to the marriage of this lone immortal and Murong Qing Si and shown joy at it, and Heavenly Court moved to wreck that plan.",
      "chapters": [
        1446
      ],
